WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:06,780
If the wild boar comes again, at least you won’t have to fly kites all the time.

2
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:12,260
Finally found a staple food that I can actually eat

3
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:14,260
Don’t dig too loosely first, focus a little more

4
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:16,260
Looks like pig's feet

5
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:20,540
Everyone, please retreat slowly and stop running around.

6
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:22,540
Don't form a group, give it a way to escape

7
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:28,630
These footprints are always there

8
00:00:28,630 --> 00:00:30,630
None of us looked at it just now

9
00:00:30,630 --> 00:00:39,606
Wu Yuxin

10
00:00:39,606 --> 00:00:45,590
send down

11
00:00:45,590 --> 00:00:51,670
Can you move? Retreat.
